# Mini strace-Like Process Monitoring Tool

**Batch 6 | Operating Systems | Computer Science and Engineering (CSE)**

**Team IDs:** 2520030223, 2520030270, 2520030301

A simplified Linux system-call tracing utility written in C using the `ptrace()` system call. The tool launches a target program, monitors it, and displays its system-call activity in the terminal. It is an educational project that helps show how user programs interact with the Linux kernel.

