## Limitations

- Tracing is simplified compared to the full `strace` utility.
- Register information is platform-dependent, and system-call numbers are architecture-specific.
- Tracing a process may require suitable permissions on the system.
- Tracing adds overhead, so a traced program runs slower than normal.

